# Joint Declaration on Shipping Context

This scope records the context and key dates associated with the Joint Declaration on Shipping.

```catala
declaration scope ShippingDeclaration:
  input signing_date content date
  input publication_date content date
  output declaration_active content boolean
```

## Declaration Context

This scope confirms the existence and context of the Joint Declaration on Shipping.

```catala
scope ShippingDeclaration:
  date round down
  definition declaration_active equals true
```